Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 08:05:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/52] Benchmark hardening before freeze: popular rivals and a
 background corpus for every person's graph

Every cross-department and fault positive gets a single-department rival with the same context and a
different service (R in {2,4,8,12}, often exceeding the routing budget); every user and department
holder gets background records, so the 10,000-user world has ~10,340 graphs with content. Identical
structure in dev and holdout; holdout bank re-sealed (6a5eabd3...b318). Engineer: WP2 (claude-sonnet-5-5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QgQYqiZ8KjrbuXgxGadraA
